- [scikit-learn multiclass classification](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/multiclass.html)
- [Study reporting no significant fingerprint–blood-group association](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29453474/)
- [WHO blood transfusion guidance](https://iris.who.int/bitstream/handle/10665/42396/a72894.pdf)
